# Authority records for the people and things behind Welte rolls, as linked data: at
# present the hands that signed the red rolls of the Condon collection, each known by a
# signature. hands#fritz is one of them. The records are served from GitHub Pages; moving
# them, for instance to a repository of their own, means changing this file only.

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^hands$ https://pfefferniels.github.io/condon-dates/names/hands.jsonld [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^.*$ https://pfefferniels.github.io/condon-dates/ [R=302,L]
